config BR2_PACKAGE_HEXAGON_DSP_BINARIES
	bool "hexagon-dsp-binaries"
	help
	  The Hexagon DSP shells and libraries the VENTUNO Q's CDSP
	  loads over FastRPC, matching the CDSP firmware from
	  linux-firmware, and the FastRPC configuration that points the
	  board at them.

	  https://github.com/linux-msm/dsp-binaries
